{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107152","id":2570304772,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZM70E","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107152","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107152.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107152.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107152","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107152/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107152/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107152/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ec12a110a98fec8eb929a8771c41e7c3ef50809b","number":107152,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add POSITION built-in to canvas-item shaders","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12558\r\n\r\nAllow overriding vertex gl_position through `POSITION` in canvas-item shaders; the same way it is possible in spatial shaders. Needed the feature for 3D text effect (clipping).\r\n\r\nCan test with this basic shader:\r\n```glsl\r\nshader_type canvas_item;\r\nrender_mode skip_vertex_transform;\r\n\r\nmat3 gen_rot_mat(vec3 r) {\r\n\tvec3 s = sin(r);\r\n\tvec3 c = cos(r);\r\n\treturn mat3(\r\n\t\tvec3(c.x*c.y, c.x*s.y*s.z - s.x*c.z, c.x*s.y*c.z + s.x*s.z),\r\n\t\tvec3(s.x*c.y, s.x*s.y*s.z + c.x*c.z, s.x*s.y*c.z - c.x*s.z),\r\n\t\tvec3(   -s.y,               c.y*s.z,               c.y*c.z)\r\n\t);\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid vertex() {\r\n\tmat4 combined_matrix = SCREEN_MATRIX * CANVAS_MATRIX * MODEL_MATRIX;\r\n\tcombined_matrix[2][3] = combined_matrix[1][1] * 0.5;\r\n\tvec4 clip_coord = combined_matrix * vec4(gen_rot_mat(vec3(0.0, TIME, 0.0)) * vec3(VERTEX, 0.0), 1.0);\r\n\tPOSITION = vec4(clip_coord.xy, 0.0, clip_coord.w);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nDemo: [test_canvas_position.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20611083/test_canvas_position.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/miles